      "finding": "The final ayin has its ordinary broad sloping foot on the baseline and clear white space below. Same-page final ayin in13:14 בצבע has the same plain foot;14:1 לנסע separately shows the small detached patah below the foot. The previous lower-foot uncertainty was a false positive. No vowel is supplied or removed.",
